  "published": "2026-10-29T20:03:15.5Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0: reliability and supply-chain release. Read-ahead Dispose and ConfigureReadAhead(0) no longer block on in-flight reads, duplicate in-flight hunks can no longer leak a semaphore permit, and shutdown cancellation is not logged as a decompression failure. Truncated CD sources now report track, frame, logical frame, source offset, sector size, bytes read and file length. The CI gate adds InspectCode, packaging, coverage, a Jekyll docs build and a chdman parity smoke; CodeQL (C# and Actions), Dependency Review, OpenSSF Scorecard, Dependabot, NuGet audit, SHA-pinned actions, secret scanning with push protection, private vulnerability reporting and provenance-attested releases harden the supply chain. No public API changes. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
